# Mutation plan for the plugin API's channel, member, sidebar, post-list, reaction and emoji
# methods (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 6).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-api-channels.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_plugin_api_channel_methods_answer_as_go_answers`: the
# channels script from inside MessageWillBePosted on a Go host and a Rust host, every answer, every
# hook the writes fire, every frame the own user's socket receives, and the Go-read assertions.
# The two hub lines are the invalidation this unit found missing on REST too. The last two lines
# are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

